This theme is a port of the Slidev theme @slidev/theme-apple-basic (https://github.com/slidevjs/themes),
designed by Jeremy Meissner (https://github.com/JeremyMeissner). The layout names and slots, CSS values and font
settings follow the original; the Angular code is new.

Images and other assets of the Slidev themes are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial) in the
original repository. None of them was copied into this package. Where an original draws a
picture, this package draws its own CSS gradients.

